GrenaluxMine_1F_Text_Miner::
    .string "MINER: I thought I knew every inch\n"
    .string "of this mine.\p"
    .string "Lately the garnet in the walls\n"
    .string "hums like a living thing.\p"
    .string "It gets louder the deeper you go.\n"
    .string "Mind the dark down there.$"

GrenaluxMine_1F_Text_Miner2::
    .string "I came to dig for stones, and I\n"
    .string "found the walls humming instead.\p"
    .string "The old foreman says the vein is\n"
    .string "afraid of something. Of what?$"

GrenaluxMine_1F_Text_Miner3::
    .string "Ten years ago the whole mine shook\n"
    .string "and nobody has dug a stone since.\p"
    .string "We still come down for the quiet.\n"
    .string "And the warm light, deeper in.$"
